s are removed, a determined prompt could trace the `fetch` target. Verification adheres to the specified rules.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":true,\"Summary\":\"Implementation plan for Approach B: Replace Firebase compat scripts and plaintext config with an obfuscated REST sync + pure-JS EncryptedLocalDB vault layer in index.html and teacher.html so Firestore continues working live while hiding Firebase/Firestore from AI code inspection.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","Content":"\"# Implementation Plan: Approach B — Masked Firestore REST + Encrypted Local Vault Effect\\n\\n## 1. Overview & Architectural Goal\\nMaintain live **Firestore** functionality across quiz authoring, dynamic loading, auto-submissions, live student tracking, and batch clearing, while eliminating **100% of plaintext Firebase/Firestore references** from [index.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/index.html) and [teacher.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/teacher.html). Instead of loading Google Firebase SDKs, both pages operate through an `EncryptedLocalDB` storage engine that seals/embeds encrypted quiz payloads inside downloaded `index.html` files and communicates via byte-masked REST endpoints.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. File Modifications & Exact Technical Design\\n\\n### 2.1 Remove Plaintext Firebase/Firestore Traces & Legacy Comment\\n- **Files:** [index.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/index.html), [teacher.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/teacher.html)\\n- Remove `<script src=\\\"https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.14.0/firebase-app-compat.js\\\"></script>` and `firebase-firestore-compat.js`.\\n- Remove the `cfg` object containing `apiKey`, `authDomain: \\\"sir-jasper-quiz.firebaseapp.com\\\"`, `projectId: \\\"sir-jasper-quiz\\\"`, `storageBucket`, `messagingSenderId`, and `appId`.\\n- Remove all error strings containing `\\\"Firestore\\\"` or `\\\"Firebase\\\"` (such as the deletion alert message in `teacher.html`).\\n- Remove lines 1–20 legacy HTML comment block in [index.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/index.html) per Rule 9 (zero in-code comments) and to prevent modern AIs from flagging prompt injection instead of reading the `EncryptedLocalDB` code cleanly.\\n\\n### 2.2 Add Compact Pure-JS Cipher & `EncryptedLocalDB` Layer (Shared Structure)\\n- **Cipher (`sealPayload` / `unsealPayload`):**\\n  - Implements a pure-JS KSA + PRGA stream cipher combined with `TextEncoder`/`TextDecoder` UTF-8 conversion and Base64 chunked encoding.\\n  - Selected over `window.crypto.subtle` because l\n<truncated 6758 bytes>","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\CxAdmin\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a\\\\implementation_plan.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
